{"lyrics":"[00:06.48]I never cared\n[00:11.42](DY Krazy)\n[00:11.64]Yeah\n[00:11.76]Uh\n[00:11.84]Bitch, I never cared, to die, was never scared\n[00:14.28]Never ever am, what I never did\n[00:17.20]You was never there, no, you never was\n[00:20.08]So I never cared 'cause there was never us\n[00:23.00]Bitch, I never cared, to die, was never scared\n[00:24.94]Never ever am, what I never did\n[00:26.68]You was never there, no, you never was\n[00:27.68]So I never cared 'cause there was never us\n[00:35.18]You was never us, that's why I'll never trust you\n[00:37.98]Tried you up on my money bust, nigga, go fuck your mother\n[00:40.44]I was too busy chasing bread, I was like fuck the butter\n[00:43.52]Now these bitches smell like butter all on them, motherfucker\n[00:46.54]And my niggas, they my brothers, fuck them other motherfuckers\n[00:49.24]If they don't love us and they lying, we gon' cut a motherfucker\n[00:52.28]We might up this bitch and pistol gun-butt a motherfucker\n[00:55.24]We got pistols, but them bitches drums, dah-dah-dah-dah\n[00:57.64]And when it's 'bout my young money, I'm Gudda Gudda, the Devil's brother\n[01:01.06]But I still gotta keep my angels humming, the Devil's brother\n[01:03.98]When I was young, I used to look up to niggas with a deal\n[01:06.08]Whatever, I love you\n[01:06.92]Now I'm a rebel, I'm living renegade, I'm like, \"Whatever, fuck 'em\"\n[01:09.76]Until that point when they just in the way, I'm like, \"Whatever, buck 'em\"\n[01:12.86]In the field, better keep that helmet on, I'm like, \"Whatever, truck 'em\"\n[01:15.78]I get high all day to fight the same devils, I must be stuck with 'em\n[01:18.64]They like, \"Damn Swervo, don't get to see you never\", I must don't fuck with 'em\n[01:21.76]He think he tough, I call him, Eazy E, gon' let his nuts kill him\n[01:24.74]Plug send them bricks, I call up Weezy We, I make them trucks fit 'em\n[01:27.70]Believe him like Lil J-Rod fucking with Ray-Ray, let them bucks hit him\n[01:31.50]Ain'